Subject: input: connect Duo Lite gamepad FF to its Awinic haptic supplier

Opt in with a DT phandle, expose standard FF_RUMBLE on the existing gamepad,
and retain Awinic ownership of I2C work and the global rumble/suspend gate.
A device link orders suspend and unbind; the supplier module stays referenced.
No app files, gamepad identity or button mappings are changed.

